   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Cover the potato and carrot with water in a medium pot and bring it to a boil.</li><li>Give them about 10 minutes, until a fork goes in easily.</li><li>Meanwhile, load the blender with the rest of the cheese ingredients (plus the chiles, if using).</li><li>Drain the vegetables, add them to the blender and run it until there are no lumps at all.</li><li>Thin with a splash more non-dairy milk if it’s too thick. Keep it warm.</li></ul>",
